This is a placeholder for the iOS executable binary.

A real runnable IPA must be built on macOS with Xcode 16+ using:
  xcodebuild -project HelloWorld.xcodeproj -scheme HelloWorld archive
  xcodebuild -exportArchive -archivePath HelloWorld.xcarchive -exportPath . -exportOptionsPlist ExportOptions.plist

The binary must be:
  - Compiled for arm64 (Apple Silicon) architecture
  - Linked against iOS 18 SDK frameworks (UIKit, SwiftUI, etc.)
  - Code-signed with an Apple Developer certificate

This IPA was generated on Linux which lacks:
  - iOS SDK (iphoneos)
  - Apple Mach-O linker (ld64)
  - Code signing tools (codesign/ldid)

See build.sh and the Xcode project for the complete build instructions.
